{"seq":2,"slug":"the-republic","title":"The Republic","docCount":2,"url":"/c/people/plato/core-contributions/the-republic","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"justice-and-the-soul","title":"正义与灵魂","url":"/c/people/plato/core-contributions/the-republic/justice-and-the-soul","wordCount":2099,"readingTime":9},{"seq":2,"slug":"the-philosopher-king","title":"哲学王","url":"/c/people/plato/core-contributions/the-republic/the-philosopher-king","wordCount":1894,"readingTime":8}],"introMarkdown":"本章呈现柏拉图政治哲学的核心——《理想国》。围绕\"什么是正义\"，柏拉图通过城邦与灵魂的同构分析，揭示了正义的本质——各部分各司其职、和谐有序。他进而提出了著名的\"哲学王\"理想——唯有兼具智慧与德性的哲学家才配统治城邦。本章揭示《理想国》关于正义、灵魂与理想政治的深刻思想，及其永恒的价值与争议。\n"}